USERDEL(8)                 System Administration                  USERDEL(8)

NAME
    userdel - delete an account

SYNOPSIS
    userdel UID

DESCRIPTION
    Delete the account with user id UID. Its home directory and files are
    left where they are, still owned by the number UID.

SECURITY
    The administrator only.

SEE ALSO
    useradd(8)
